<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:17px;font-weight:600;"><%= @listing.name %> is live.</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;">Agents can find it in the catalog, the x402 Bazaar and their MCP tools, and pay for it per call. Each call we forward carries a <span style="font-family:ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace">BotTrunk-Signature</span> header: check it, and refuse calls that did not come through us.</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 22px 0;">
  <%= receipt_row "Paid endpoint", "https://api.bottrunk.com/s/#{@listing.slug}", mono: true %>
  <%= receipt_row "Price", "#{usdc(@listing.price_atomic)} USDC per call", mono: true %>
  <%= receipt_row "You keep", "85% of each settled call", mono: false %>
  <%= receipt_row "Note", @listing.review_notes %>
</table>

<p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;"><%= mail_button "See your listing", seller_root_url %></p>

<p style="margin:0;color:#666666;font-size:13px;">The price is fixed from the first paid call. To change it later, list the API again under a new name.</p>
